# Passable —— 供給之憑。此為樣板,copy 為 .env.local 而填之。
#   cp .env.local.example .env.local
#
# 二者皆闕,則 app 全可用而无登入 —— 报事存于本地,不入云。
# 此非降级,乃其常道:離網可用,故不以后端为其前提。
#
# Both blank is a fully supported mode: the app works, routing works, and
# reports are kept in local storage. Sign-in is not offered rather than being
# offered-and-broken. Fill these in only when the Supabase project exists.
#
# 取之于 Supabase dashboard: Project Settings -> API
# anon key 本为公开之物(RLS 御之),然不硬写于码,故在此。
# The anon key is designed to be public — RLS is what protects the data — but it
# still does not belong in the repository.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
